## Smoke test mapping

Every endpoint above has a corresponding probe in `scripts/smoke-test.sh`. The probe:

1. Sends an authenticated request.
2. Asserts HTTP 200.
3. Asserts a non-empty response body.
4. Logs the result.

If you add an endpoint to this document, add its probe to `scripts/smoke-test.sh` before merging.

